bb00000008        # emitted program frame base = 0x8000000 (was 0x4000000; raised 2026-09-04 so globals stay below the frame at 12M+ opt buffers -- D-01 fix). Globals grow up from
                  # 0x700000; raised with SPILL (0x3F00000) to enlarge the global arena as the frontend
                  # grew past the old 24MB (self-host rzir now >3.8MB per stage). 0x4000000 gives a ~56MB
                  # global arena; frames grow up 0x20000/level with ~192MB headroom below argv@0x10000000.
